        "solution_text": "$\\sqrt{11+5}\\times 2$\n$=\\sqrt{16}\\times 2$\n$=4\\times 2$\n$=8$"
      },
      {
        "question_text": "Evaluate $45\\div\\sqrt{17+8}$.",
        "solution_text": "$45\\div\\sqrt{17+8}$\n$=45\\div\\sqrt{25}$\n$=45\\div 5$\n$=9$"
      },
      {
        "question_text": "Evaluate $3^{3}-\\sqrt{9}$.",
        "solution_text": "$3^{3}-\\sqrt{9}$\n$=27-3$\n$=24$"
      },
