        "solution_text": "$\\sqrt{3^{2}+4^{2}}$\n$=\\sqrt{9+16}$\n$=\\sqrt{25}$\n$=5$"
      },
      {
        "question_text": "Evaluate $\\sqrt{5^{2}-3^{2}}$.",
